  "title": "Pecos Pasta",
  "description": "A sweet saute of bell peppers and onions is stirred into canned chili with beans and canned corn to make a quick and hearty sauce for cooked macaroni. Try grating Cheddar cheese and sprinkling olive slices over the top.",
